ass=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-500 text-white rounded text-xs font-semibold shadow\">本編を見る</a></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-800/40 transition\">\n            <td class=\"p-3 font-medium text-white max-w-xs truncate\">顔65点、体120点。実家暮らし、週8オナニーの私。歯科助手を目指すフェチKカップ女子大生（21）こう見えて大型新人 白石こはる <br><span class=\"text-xs text-pink-400 font-mono\">EBWH00361</span></td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">白石こはる</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-400\">E-BODY</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">至近距離密着ピストン＆濃厚フィニッシュ</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-center\"><a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Debwh00361&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-500 text-white rounded text-xs font-semibold shadow\">本編を見る</a></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-800/40 transition\">\n            <td class=\"p-3 font-medium text-white max-w-xs truncate\">新人！日高ゆあAVデビュー。9頭身、発見。彼氏にナイショで野獣イキまくりSEX。 <br><span class=\"text-xs text-pink-400 font-mono\">PRST00027</span></td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">日高ゆあ</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-400\">プレミアム</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-slate-300\">至近距離密着ピストン＆濃厚フィニッシュ</td>\n            <td class=\"p-3 text-center\"><a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Dprst00027&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-500 text-white rounded text-xs font-semibold shadow\">本編を見る</a></td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 作品別徹底詳細レビュー（1作品ずつ長文解説） -->\n  <section class=\"space-y-12\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-l-4 border-pink-500 pl-3\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-